>Portable solar input quick card
Confirm input voltage, current, power, polarity and connectors before connecting.
Cold-weather open-circuit array voltage must be within the station's limit. Follow the maker's connection order. Secure the panel and keep the station dry and ventilated. Stop if leads are damaged or heat develops unexpectedly. Never connect to fixed house wiring.

